# i2cscope scenario template — copy to /sd/i2cscope/<name>.scn and edit.
#
# Header:
#   name <free text shown in the title>
#   addr 0xNN              7-bit device address
#
# Steps:  <type> <reg> <unit> <label...>
#   byte   1-byte register read (0..255)
#   word   2-byte little-endian (SMBus word)
#   sword  2-byte little-endian, signed (e.g. current)
#   hex    2-byte, shown as 0xXXXX (status/flags)
#   temp   2-byte 0.1 K, shown as degrees C
#   unit "-" = no unit
#
# Everything is read through the SDK libsmbus over /dev/i2c-0.
name Template
addr 0x48
byte  0x00 -    Config
word  0x00 raw  Sample
temp  0x00 -    Probe
hex   0x01 -    Status
